---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import MarketingChrome from "../../components/MarketingChrome.astro";

const phoneDisplay = "(501) 413-3386";
const tel = "tel:+15014133386";
const sms = "sms:+15014133386";
---

<Base
  title="Mobile Detailing Websites in Las Vegas, Free Demo | NV Labs"
  description="A free demo website for your Las Vegas mobile detailing business with packages, service area, and a booking form. Call or text (501) 413-3386."
  image="/og.png"
  robots="index, follow"
>
  <MarketingChrome>
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Las Vegas mobile detailing</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">A website for your mobile detailing business in Las Vegas</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Free demo first. Packages, service area, and a booking form. Call or text to get started.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-accent btn-lg" href={tel}>Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href={sms}>Text me</a>
        <a class="btn btn-text" href="/mobile-mechanic-website/">Mobile mechanic websites</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="vegas-title">
      <h2 id="vegas-title">Vegas is rough on cars</h2>
      <p>
        Between the sun, the dust, and the hard water, cars here take a beating. Your customers know
        it. They're looking for someone who can bring the shine back without them leaving home or
        work.
      </p>
      <p>Your site will explain what you do in plain words, and show the results.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="pkg-title">
      <h2 id="pkg-title">Packages people understand</h2>
      <p>Detailing terms can confuse people. I'll lay out your packages so they're easy to compare:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Exterior wash and wax</li>
        <li>Full interior detail</li>
        <li>Full in and out detail</li>
        <li>Paint correction and polish</li>
        <li>Ceramic coating</li>
        <li>Headlight restoration</li>
        <li>Fleet or dealership service</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Each package gets a short description of what's included. If you prefer to quote each job,
        we'll say that instead.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="photos-title">
      <h2 id="photos-title">Before and after photos</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing sells a detail like a filthy interior next to the same car looking brand new. I'll
        set up a photo gallery that shows your best transformations on phones, where most people
        will see it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="hoa-title">
      <h2 id="hoa-title">Water and HOA questions</h2>
      <p>
        People in HOA communities sometimes ask if you can work in their driveway, or whether you
        bring your own water and power. If you use waterless or rinseless methods, or bring
        everything with you, I'll spell that out. It answers the question before they have to ask.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="area-title">
      <h2 id="area-title">Where you go</h2>
      <p>
        Your service area will be clear: Summerlin, Henderson, Southern Highlands, North Las Vegas,
        Mountain's Edge, or wherever you work. If you also do offices and parking garages, we'll
        mention that. Customers want to know right away if you come to them.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="book-title">
      <h2 id="book-title">Book by text or form</h2>
      <p>
        I'll add a booking form that asks for the vehicle type, the package they want, their area,
        and a preferred time. Or a big "Text to Book" button if that's how you like to work. I'm
        based in Las Vegas, and I'll build your demo and text you the link. If you like it, I put it
        live. We work by call and text.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <h2 id="faq-title">FAQ</h2>
      <div class="faq">
        <div>
          <h3>Can customers book a specific time through the site?</h3>
          <p>
            Yes. I can link your booking app or add a request form, and you confirm each job by
            text.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>I quote every job differently. Do I need to list packages?</h3>
          <p>
            No. We can describe what you offer and use a quote request form instead. Many detailers
            work that way.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Can the site show I'm insured?</h3>
          <p>If you are, yes. I'll add a short line about it, worded the way you want.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
      <h2 id="cta-title">Let's get your detailing demo built</h2>
      <p>Text me your business name and what you offer.</p>
      <a class="phone-big" href={tel}>{phoneDisplay}</a>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-accent btn-lg" href={tel}>Call</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href={sms}>Text</a>
      </div>
      <a class="back-home" href="/">Back to NV Labs home</a>
    </section>
  </MarketingChrome>
</Base>
